<item><title>Gambia&apos;s Alliance of Progressive Citizens joins UDP-led coalition before presidential vote</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/gm/gambia-s-alliance-of-progressive-citizens-joins-udp-led-bc55f0/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/gm/gambia-s-alliance-of-progressive-citizens-joins-udp-led-bc55f0/</guid><category>Gambia</category><description>Lamin Sima signed a memorandum of understanding in Jarra Soma, aligning his party with the United Democratic Party (UDP) alliance behind Ousainou Darboe.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:17:25 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gm.jpg" length="31578" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gm.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Gambia&apos;s central bank holds policy rate at 14% as inflation rises</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/gm/gambia-s-central-bank-holds-policy-rate-at-14-as-inflation-11ee12/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/gm/gambia-s-central-bank-holds-policy-rate-at-14-as-inflation-11ee12/</guid><category>Gambia</category><description>The Monetary Policy Committee kept three other rates unchanged after inflation climbed to 6.3% in October, ending three months of declines.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 20:03:17 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/gm/gambia-s-central-bank-holds-policy-rate-at-14-as-inflation-11ee12/share.jpg" length="41505" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/gm/gambia-s-central-bank-holds-policy-rate-at-14-as-inflation-11ee12/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
